<task id="020" project="code-quality-and-assurance-r3">
  <metadata>
    <title>BFF Tranche A: delete the low-contention dead-code items (Scopes, RetryPolicies, StubLiveFactResolver, archives)</title>
    <phase>2 BFF Remediation</phase>
    <tranche>A</tranche>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Deletes source + an archived test; BFF hot-path code → code-review + adr-check unconditionally at Step 9.5.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Mechanical deletion against a verified inventory with exact file paths; Sonnet default.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>BFF hot-path contention (19 worktrees touch BFF); /conflict-check before each PR; small sequential PRs.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>none</deps>
    <tags>bff,dead-code,tranche-a</tags>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Delete the low-contention dead-code items from Sprk.Bff.Api (bff design §3.1, Tranche A): the Scopes folder (Services/Scopes/{ScopeInheritanceService,ScopeCopyService,OwnershipValidator}.cs, ~1,285 LOC), orphaned Infrastructure/Resilience/RetryPolicies.cs (~298 LOC), StubLiveFactResolver.cs (~56 LOC, owner-APPROVED for deletion), both _archive/ folders, and the archived test. The Safety cluster is deliberately NOT in this task — it touches heavily-contested Services/Ai and is handled in Tranche B (task 029). Verify against src/ AND tests/ before deleting. PRESERVE the explicit KEEPs.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer with BFF cleanup expertise. Follow root CLAUDE.md §10 BFF Hygiene + ADR-032. Delete &gt; deprecate; behavior-preserving.</role>
  <goal>The Tranche-A dead-code items are removed with zero dangling references (grep-verified against src/ and tests/), dotnet build + full dotnet test green, and the publish-size delta vs 44.96 MB incl PDBs (net10 baseline; net8 was 46.89) reported.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>spec.md FR-06. The BFF assessment (Fable-verified) confirmed these items are provably dead in src/ AND tests/ (BFF exposes internals via InternalsVisibleTo to 3 test assemblies, so test refs were checked explicitly). The verification pass CORRECTED 2 first-pass false positives that are load-bearing and MUST be preserved: StubInsightGraph (wired InsightsModule.cs:53) and the Todo NullObject/ + Placeholder/ ADR-032 factory pair (TodoSyncModule.cs:84-98). The Safety cluster (6 src in Services/Ai/* + 2 test files) is split into Tranche B (task 029) because Services/Ai is the most-contested area (many AI worktrees).</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Scopes/ScopeInheritanceService.cs</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Scopes/ScopeCopyService.cs</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Scopes/OwnershipValidator.cs</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Resilience/RetryPolicies.cs</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Insights/LiveFacts/StubLiveFactResolver.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Insights/Graph/StubInsightGraph.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Todo/NullObject</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">projects/code-quality-and-assurance-r3/workstreams/bff-api/design.md</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="none" status="complete">BFF already assessed (workstream #1); this executes the verified inventory.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">Scope (BFF Tranche-A dead-code only): delete exactly Scopes folder (3), RetryPolicies.cs, StubLiveFactResolver.cs, both _archive/ folders, the archived test. Do NOT delete the Safety cluster here (task 029) and do NOT delete anything else.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-032">Scope: PRESERVE the KEEPs — StubInsightGraph.cs (wired InsightsModule.cs:53) and Todo NullObject/ + Placeholder/ factory pair (TodoSyncModule.cs:84-98). These are ADR-032 seams, verified load-bearing.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: verify dead code against src/ AND tests/ (InternalsVisibleTo to 3 test assemblies) before each deletion — grep both trees for references.</constraint>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md-§10">Scope: BFF publish ≤ 60 MB compressed (baseline 44.96 MB incl PDBs (net10 baseline; net8 was 46.89)); report absolute size + delta in notes. No new NuGet packages. Run /conflict-check against projects/INDEX.md before the PR.</constraint>
    <constraint source="net10-2026-08-14">Optional net10-surfaced dead-code addition (Fable-verified at HEAD): ~32 dead `catch (ServiceException)` sites remain in 5 files — `UploadSessionManager` (17), `ContainerOperations` (9), `SpeContainerMembershipService` (4), `SpeAdminGraphService` (1), `SendEmailNodeExecutor` (1) — belt-and-suspenders catches for a type Kiota 2.0 no longer throws (master converted `DriveItemOperations` to `catch (ODataError)` but left these). May be folded into this deletion, copying the `DriveItemOperations` migration pattern. ⚠️ `SpeAdminGraphService`/`SendEmailNodeExecutor` are contested (`Services/Ai`/SPE) → quiet-window; the low-contention ones can land here. Note: `ServiceException` IS retained in Graph.Core 4.x, so removing only the DEAD catches (unreachable given ODataError) — verify unreachability per site.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>BFF dead-code removal</topic>
    <files>
      <file>projects/code-quality-and-assurance-r3/workstreams/bff-api/design.md</file>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-032-bff-nullobject-kill-switch.md</file>
      <file>.claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md</file>
    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor declaration">Output the rigor-level declaration (FULL). Read bff design §3.1 dead-code table + the explicit KEEPs.</step>
    <step order="1">Run /conflict-check against projects/INDEX.md; if the Scopes/Resilience/Insights files are contended, coordinate/sequence before proceeding.</step>
    <step order="2">For each item, grep src/ AND tests/ for references to confirm zero live consumers; abort an individual deletion if any live ref is found (the KEEPs prove first-pass audits can be wrong).</step>
    <step order="3">Delete the Scopes folder (3 files), orphaned RetryPolicies.cs, StubLiveFactResolver.cs, both _archive/ folders (remove the now-empty folders), and the archived test.</step>
    <step order="4">Run dotnet build src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ + full dotnet test; confirm green.</step>
    <step order="5">Run dotnet publish -c Release to deploy/api-publish/, measure compressed size, record absolute + delta vs 44.96 MB incl PDBs (net10 baseline; net8 was 46.89) in notes/publish-size-report.md.</step>
    <step order="6">Update TASK-INDEX.md: set task 020 status to ✅.</step>
    <step order="7">Document any deviation in projects/code-quality-and-assurance-r3/notes/.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
    <trigger>If grep finds ANY live consumer (src/ or tests/) of an item slated for deletion, STOP that deletion and escalate — the item is not dead (the BFF pass already found 2 such false positives).</trigger>
  </escalation>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ (Tranche-A dead-code items removed)</output>
    <output type="doc">projects/code-quality-and-assurance-r3/notes/publish-size-report.md</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the deletions, grep of src/ AND tests/ returns zero dangling references to any removed type; both _archive/ folders are gone.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the build, dotnet build is clean and full dotnet test is green.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the KEEPs, StubInsightGraph.cs and the Todo NullObject/+Placeholder/ pair still exist and are still wired.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Publish size reported ≤ 60 MB compressed with delta vs 44.96 MB incl PDBs (net10 baseline; net8 was 46.89); no new NuGet package added.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Maps spec.md FR-06 / bff design §3.1 + Phase 1. **Tranche A** (low-contention paths — do first). Safety cluster deletion split to task 029 (Tranche B, contested Services/Ai). FULL rigor.</notes>

  <execution><skill>.claude/skills/task-execute/SKILL.md</skill></execution>
</task>
